cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Programmazione lineare intera: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Programmazione lineare intera course — linear functions,
  polyhedra, LP problems, the simplex algorithm, duality, revised and dual
  methods, sensitivity analysis, modelling techniques — with definitions,
  theorems and proofs, worked examples, a catalogue of LP problems and
  exercises with solutions.
